error[SC0104]: this `#ifndef` asks about a name the implementation may define
   ╭─[ a_reserved_guard_is_refused.h:1:1 ]
   │
 1 │ #ifndef _MT
   │ ┬  
   │ ╰── directive begins here
───╯
  = note: `_MT` is reserved for the implementation (C17 7.1.3), and whether it is defined depends on the compiler, so none of this conditional's groups is compiled
  = help: say whether the build defines it: `-D _MT` if it does, `-U _MT` if it does not
